#: ../../source/tencirpauli.rst:2
msgid "TenCirPauli Plugin"
msgstr "TenCirPauli 插件"

#: ../../source/tencirpauli.rst:4
msgid ""
"`TenCirPauli <https://github.com/tensorcircuit/TenCirPauli>`_ is a "
"Python-first, Rust-native companion for TensorCircuit-NG. Its two main "
"entry points are approximate circuit simulation with Pauli propagation "
"and backpropagation, and fast fixed-particle-number circuit simulation."
msgstr ""
"`TenCirPauli <https://github.com/tensorcircuit/TenCirPauli>`_ 是 "
"TensorCircuit-NG 的 Python 优先、Rust "
"原生配套包。它的两个主要入口是：基于泡利传播与反向传播的近似线路模拟，以及快速的固定粒子数线路模拟。"

#: ../../source/tencirpauli.rst:8
msgid "TenCirPauli on GitHub"
msgstr "GitHub 上的 TenCirPauli"

#: ../../source/tencirpauli.rst:12
msgid "Read the full benchmarks and implementation details."
msgstr "阅读完整的基准测试和实现细节。"

#: ../../source/tencirpauli.rst:14
msgid "TenCirPauli Documentation"
msgstr "TenCirPauli 文档"

#: ../../source/tencirpauli.rst:18
msgid "Read the user guide and API reference."
msgstr "阅读用户指南和 API 参考。"

#: ../../source/tencirpauli.rst:21
msgid "Installation"
msgstr "安装"

#: ../../source/tencirpauli.rst:23
msgid "Install the companion package alongside TensorCircuit-NG:"
msgstr "将配套包与 TensorCircuit-NG 一起安装："

#: ../../source/tencirpauli.rst:29
msgid ""
"The package complements TensorCircuit-NG rather than replacing its "
"general-purpose circuit and tensor-network simulators. Use TensorCircuit-"
"NG to construct circuits and work with its differentiable backend "
"interface, then hand off suitable structured workloads to TenCirPauli."
msgstr ""
"该包是对 TensorCircuit-NG 的补充，而不是替代其通用线路和张量网络模拟器。请使用 TensorCircuit-NG "
"构建线路并使用其可微后端接口，然后将适合的结构化工作负载交给 TenCirPauli。"

#: ../../source/tencirpauli.rst:32
msgid "Pauli propagation"
msgstr "泡利传播"

#: ../../source/tencirpauli.rst:34
msgid ""
"TenCirPauli provides approximate circuit simulation based on Pauli "
"propagation. It can import a regular TensorCircuit circuit, propagate "
"Pauli operators through the circuit, and return observable values "
"together with gate-parameter gradients:"
msgstr ""
"TenCirPauli 提供基于泡利传播的近似线路模拟。它可以导入普通的 TensorCircuit "
"线路，将泡利算符传播通过线路，并返回观测量值以及门参数梯度："

#: ../../source/tencirpauli.rst:57
msgid ""
"TenCirPauli is substantially faster than `PauliPropagation.jl "
"<https://github.com/SparqleSim/PauliPropagation.jl>`_. See the "
"`TenCirPauli performance comparisons "
"<https://tensorcircuit.github.io/TenCirPauli/performance/>`_ for the "
"benchmark details."
msgstr ""
"TenCirPauli 比 `PauliPropagation.jl "
"<https://github.com/SparqleSim/PauliPropagation.jl>`_ 快得多。基准细节见 "
"`TenCirPauli 性能对比 "
"<https://tensorcircuit.github.io/TenCirPauli/performance/>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/tencirpauli.rst:60
msgid "Fixed-particle-number circuits"
msgstr "固定粒子数线路"

#: ../../source/tencirpauli.rst:62
msgid ""
"TensorCircuit-NG already provides :py:class:`tensorcircuit.U1Circuit` for"
" particle-number-conserving simulations. TenCirPauli provides a faster "
"Rust implementation for this same class of circuits. It avoids JAX JIT "
"compilation's cold-start overhead:"
msgstr ""
"TensorCircuit-NG 已经提供了用于粒子数守恒模拟的 "
":py:class:`tensorcircuit.U1Circuit`。TenCirPauli 为同一类线路提供了更快的 Rust 实现。它避免了"
" JAX JIT 编译的冷启动开销："

#: ../../source/tencirpauli.rst:81
msgid "Structured operators and MVPs"
msgstr "结构化算符与 MVP"

#: ../../source/tencirpauli.rst:83
msgid ""
"TenCirPauli offers backend-compatible matrix-vector-product (MVP) "
"interfaces for structured fermionic, bosonic, Majorana, qudit, and hybrid"
" operators. It also provides fermion-to-qubit mappings and import paths "
"from quantum-chemistry libraries, so these operators can be used directly"
" in TensorCircuit workflows without materializing dense matrices."
msgstr ""
"TenCirPauli 为结构化费米子、玻色子、Majorana、qudit 和混合算符提供后端兼容的矩阵-向量积 (MVP) "
"接口。它还提供费米子到量子比特的映射以及从量子化学库导入的路径，因此这些算符可以直接用于 TensorCircuit 工作流，而无需物化稠密矩阵。"

#: ../../source/tencirpauli.rst:85
msgid ""
"For example, a molecular Hamiltonian from PySCF can be mapped to a Pauli-"
"string MVP:"
msgstr "例如，来自 PySCF 的分子哈密顿量可以映射为泡利串 MVP："

